{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21582","headline":"送王十一郎游剡中 · 元稹","name":"送王十一郎游剡中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越州都在浙河湾，尘土消沈景象闲。\n百里油盆镜湖水，千峰钿朵会稽山。\n军城楼阁随高下，禹庙烟霞自往还。\n想得玉郎乘画舸，几回明月坠云间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}